[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7922.629, "timestamp": "02:12:02", "text": "我用的是28寸的2060 Super，呃，2060呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7925.99, "timestamp": "02:12:05", "text": "双风扇，就是那款索泰显卡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7928.75, "timestamp": "02:12:08", "text": "我的风扇出了问题，风扇粘滞。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7932.709, "timestamp": "02:12:12", "text": "这个问题已经存在了。我已经解决了这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7935.669, "timestamp": "02:12:15", "text": "换个风扇什么的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7937.99, "timestamp": "02:12:17", "text": "因为保修期已过。所以我不得不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7941.43, "timestamp": "02:12:21", "text": "我自己又订了一份，结果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7944.79, "timestamp": "02:12:24", "text": "应该可以正常工作，但GPU也过载了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7946.79, "timestamp": "02:12:26", "text": "时间已逝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7949.069, "timestamp": "02:12:29", "text": "真倒霉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7953.27, "timestamp": "02:12:33", "text": "是的。我当时就想，哇。我不。然后我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7955.75, "timestamp": "02:12:35", "text": "感觉就像已经要去日本了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7959.83, "timestamp": "02:12:39", "text": "那件事是事先计划好的。所以，我就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7961.75, "timestamp": "02:12:41", "text": "就像我开始追求寒冷一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7965.51, "timestamp": "02:12:45", "text": "东西。所以我就想，“好吧，也许呃……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7968.31, "timestamp": "02:12:48", "text": "如果真是那样的话，或许我应该试试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7970.95, "timestamp": "02:12:50", "text": "去买那台笔记本电脑。那样会更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7974.31, "timestamp": "02:12:54", "text": "就像真的很想成为那样的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7978.87, "timestamp": "02:12:58", "text": "相同的配置，相同的电脑具体配置"}]